{"suttaId":"tha-ap220","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7725,7746],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"tha-ap220:0.3":"Akkantasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap220:1.1":"“Kusāṭakaṃ gahetvāna, upajjhāyassahaṃ pure;","tha-ap220:1.3":"Mantañca anusikkhāmi, ganthādosassa [kaṇḍabhedassa (sī.), gaṇḍabhedassa (syā.)] pattiyā.","tha-ap220:2.1":"“Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ;","tha-ap220:2.3":"Usabhaṃ pavaraṃ aggaṃ, tissaṃ buddhaṃ gaṇuttamaṃ [gajuttamaṃ (syā.)].","tha-ap220:3.1":"“Kusāṭakaṃ pattharitaṃ, akkamantaṃ naruttamaṃ;","tha-ap220:3.3":"Samuggataṃ mahāvīraṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap220:4.1":"“Disvā taṃ lokapajjotaṃ, vimalaṃ candasannibhaṃ;","tha-ap220:4.3":"Avandiṃ satthuno pāde, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap220:5.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ adāsiṃ kusāṭakaṃ;","tha-ap220:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, kusāṭakassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap220:6.1":"“Sattatiṃse ito kappe, eko āsiṃ janādhipo;","tha-ap220:6.3":"Sunando nāma nāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap220:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap220:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā akkantasaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap220:9.1":"Akkantasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
